  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 3 ranks, Faction sphere ((retainer) package, any talent granting a retainer profession with a combatant role).</p>\n<p>You can requisition two combatant retainers at a time. You must pay the authorization costs for each retainer, and the maximum level or Hit Dice for each one is reduced by 1 while you have two of them.</p>\n<p>You can take this talent a second time. If you do, having two retainers does not reduce their maximum level. You can also choose to requisition a third combatant retainer, but if you do all three have their maximum level or Hit Dice are reduced by 1 each.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/faction#toc59\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
